<span id="A1.T5.1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Restricts commercial use but may allow derivatives under varying terms (for example, CC BY-NC, other custom non-commercial licenses).</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.1.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.1.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:71.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.1.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Originated from CC class</span>
</span></td></tr>
