<span id="A1.T5.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:71.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.1.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">ND (NO DERIVATIVES)</span>
</span></td>
