<td id="A1.T5.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.1.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:71.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.1.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">COPYLEFT</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.1.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.1.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Strong copyleft licenses requiring derivatives to be licensed under the same or compatible terms.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.1.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.1.6.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:71.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.1.6.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Originated from Open Source and Data Class</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.1.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:71.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.1.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">ML_LICENSE</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.1.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.1.7.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.1.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Machine Learning Licenses often including specific considerations for how providers use models, as well as obligations on downstream applications similar to copyleft.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.1.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T5.1.7.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:71.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T5.1.7.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Originated from Machine Learning Class</span>
</span></td></tr>
